    "body": "Conducted an extensive project audit and bug research session. Prepared a highly detailed, professional BUG_RESEARCH_REPORT.md file. Resolved all 6 pre-existing test suite errors and failures by fixing backward-compatibility serialization mismatches in ChromaDB/numpy/scipy dependencies, and updating outdated API references and key index lookups in tests/test_cognitive_memory.py. All 625 tests now pass cleanly with zero regressions.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [2769885343348966203](https://jules.google.com/task/2769885343348966203) started by @1h0lde4*",
