      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "This submission provides a comprehensive audit report of the OCBrain v4.1 repository, systematically identifying logic flaws, architectural risks, and implementation gaps.\n\nKey findings include:\n- **RES-01**: A race condition in `AdaptiveSemaphore` leading to resource leaks.\n- **GOV-01**: Mandatory governance bypasses in the Orchestrator.\n- **STA-01**: Global monkeypatching of the `sqlite3` module causing unintended side effects.\n- **MEM-01/02**: O(N) scaling bottlenecks in memory retrieval.\n\nThe report includes concrete, refactored code blocks for remediation. Reproduction scripts for the semaphore race condition are included in `tools/repro/`.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [10567889854448240773](https://jules.google.com/task/10567889854448240773) started by @1h0lde4*",
    "created_at": "2026-06-29T17:41:28Z",
